      "start_seconds": 201.7,
      "end_seconds": 214.62,
      "duration_seconds": 12.92,
      "text": "here are the numbers, doctor. Temperature is 36.7 degrees, blood pressure 122 over 68, pulse is 73 beats a minute, respiratory rate 16, SpO2 98 percent on room air"
